Package: ProcessBatchATB
Title: Process Batch Fermentation (BMP) Assay Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Given", "Family", , "email@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a reproducible pipeline for processing batch fermentation
    (biochemical methane potential, BMP) assay data within the standard method 
    of the working group "biogenic ressources" of ATB, following VDI 4630. Handles
    import of sample protocols and gas measurement sheets, calculates normalised
    biogas and methane volumes, applies blank correction, evaluates the VDI 4630
    termination criterion, and summarises daily and cumulative yields per
    substrate. Analytics data (inoculum composition, substrate characterisation)
    is processed via the ProcessLabAssistant package.
